msgid "Funqy HTTP Binding with AWS Lambda "
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you want to allow HTTP clients to invoke on your Funqy functions on AWS "
"Lambda, Quarkus allows you to expose multiple\n"
"Funqy functions through HTTP deployed as one AWS Lambda.  This approach does "
"add overhead over the\n"
"regular Funqy AWS Lambda integration and also requires you to use AWS API "
"Gateway."
msgstr ""

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not "
"guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and "
"plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-"
"dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-"
"are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Follow the xref:aws-lambda-http.adoc[AWS Lambda Http Guide].  It walks "
"through using a variety of HTTP\n"
"frameworks on AWS Lambda, including Funqy."
msgstr ""

msgid "An additional Quickstart"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Beyond generating an AWS project that is covered in the xref:aws-lambda-http."
"adoc[AWS Lambda Http Guide],\n"
"there's also a quickstart for running Funqy HTTP on AWS Lambda."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Clone the Git repository: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, or download "
"an {quickstarts-archive-url}[archive]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The solution is located in the `funqy-amazon-lambda-quickstart` link:"
"{quickstarts-tree-url}/funqy-quickstarts/funqy-amazon-lambda-http-"
"quickstart[directory]."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Code"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"There is nothing special about the code and more importantly nothing AWS "
"specific.  Funqy functions can be deployed to many\n"
"environments and AWS Lambda is one of them.  The Java code is actually the "
"same exact code as the link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/funqy-quickstarts/funqy-"
"http-quickstart[funqy-http-quickstart]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The steps to get this quickstart running are exactly the same as defined in "
"the xref:aws-lambda-http.adoc[AWS Lambda HTTP Guide].\n"
"These differences are that you are running from a quickstart and the maven "
"dependencies are slightly different."
msgstr ""
